e seen to  have been carved to create small shelves  speckled with indiscernible filth an  ancient cast iron lidded pot sits in the  center of the room atop a mound of  partially burnt petrified wood encircled  by rocks on the left discoloration in a  roughly three by one area of the cave's  rear suggests former existence of  bedding in that corner long since rotted  away  special operative nix takes two steps in  before stopping short she looks to k9121  who remains outside the cave entrance  head lightly bowed and its tail tucked  between its legs special operative nicks  heads over to k9121  kneels down and coddles the animal  petting it and commanding it to remain  in place standing back up she moves  inside to check the shelves small bits  of wicker possibly some form of  ornamentation crumble upon being touched  advancing to the pot a carving can be  seen on its side which she inspects she  removes the pot's lid and gags it is  shown to be filled with a murky brown  pool of stagnant water within which  floats several objects unable to be made  out  until special operative knicks activates  her headlamp and gasps at the side of  over a dozen small bones based off of  the most clearly visible of these an  ulna it is estimated that the remains  belong to an individual no more than two  months of age  the display is further plagued by static  special operative nicks replaces the lid  and sets the pot down carefully she  pauses momentarily partly stands and  staggers and then proceeds to fall to  her knees and vomit profusely she curses  quietly and sniffles afterwards for a  minute obscuring the camera feed as she  wipes her face  looking up a small nook in the cave wall  can be seen at foot level beside where  the bed previously lay something small  and brown is inside it special operative  nicks takes a few deep breaths then  raises to a stand  static builds as special operative nix  crosses over to investigate she kneels  places her hand inside  and pulls out the object the visual  field is overcome by white noise though  special operative nicks can still be  heard who reports finding some form of  diary flipping through the first few  weathered pages reveals little of  important any content that may have once  been present has long since faded she  continues to scan the document when a  hollow popping noise rings out  turning quickly no immediate threat or  change in surroundings is seen  k9121 begins approaching cautiously  another sharp wet pop noise is heard  k9121 growls at special operative nicks  and glances about for the noise's source  it sounds off a third time and the lid  of the cast iron pot vibrates as it is  struck from within  special operative nicks flees the cave  with d-774's remains being tended to by  director kim agent collins and dr  lafayette arrive at the control room  agent collins dons the headset and  announces her presence to special  operative knicks  special operative nix has reached the  top of shallow's peak by the time  command is able to reach her and relays  the events of the previous hour from her  perspective she is clearly able to see  both the replicate tembi to the east  where she entered as well as its  iterative copy to the west in the cell  she now occupies in a panoramic shot a  dozen windmills of further tempi  replicates  can be viewed far off in the distance  she explains to command that although  the pattern of the surrounding areas  supports the recursive iteration theory  of this dimension's layout that there  are noted inconsistencies within the  grid she inhabits beyond the cave which  did not exist in baseline or replicate  tembi she points out a small grove of  dead trees that seemingly has no  parallel elsewhere in the grid  similarly special operative nix claims  to have spotted an unidentifiable  structure in the town center of tembi in  her cell  upon query from command as to why there  would be a deviation from the pattern  special operative nix suggests that the  presence of d2172  across the boundary of two iterations  may be causing fluctuations in the  integrity of the grid cell she occupies  likening it to cellular lysis special  operative next explains how the border  between spatial zones could be weakened  by foreign material occupying two cells  in a grid simultaneously for an extended  period of time  a problem that prohibited the building  of outpost 41 with scp  several years prior  despite the instability of this cell  she posits that the defamations in this  zone may be reflections of the  historical state of tembi and therefore  present a valuable research opportunity  that merits further exploration  special operative nix begins her descent  small cracks and pops can be heard still  reverberating within the cave as she  passes  she does not look inside  someone is sobbing  at the bottom of the hill a path of dead  grass and foliage can be seen where  previously  d2172's leg had lane  k9121 sniffs about this area and begins  following the trail further into the  cell  in the direction of the next tembi the  two travel at a steady pace with special  operative nicks checking regularly  behind them  as they progress the forest slightly  darkens as cloud cover obscures the sun  a sharp report of bone snapping echoes  in the distance  special operative nicks holds a shotgun  in a low ready position and double  checks the safety  another crack the splintering of bones  sounds off repeatedly from an  indiscernible source as special  operative nicks levels her weapon  attempting to follow the noise another  crack  small branches and leaves fall and  flitter about as the foot of d-2172  emerges from the canopy dangling from  above it quickly twists and breaks  turning to face special operative necks  with its toes  it is immediately met with three rapid  bursts of bug shot the appendage dangles  loosely dripping blood from its shredded  remains  the foot is almost entirely destroyed  consisting of chunks of flesh suspended  by the ankle with only the posterior and  anterior digits remaining it lulls to  and fro from the concussive force of the  shots swaying impotently  k9121 snarls and barks at the appendage  special operative nix keeps her weapon  trained on it as the two work to  carefully circumvent it  it is as they pass it that the appendage  swiftly plunges into the ground  trailed by several meters of leg the  appendage is swollen from countless  fractures across its length  giving it dozens of points of extra  articulation special operative nicks  breaks into a run as the coiled mass  begins to shift  the two barrel through the forest  k9121 in the lead leaping and dodging  over obstacles in the terrain behind  them a fuhrer of rustling and banging  can be heard as the leg bursts through  the foliage and violently rebounds off  trees tearing through the woods in  pursuit special operative necks takes a  sharp right then it left followed by  another right in an attempt to carve a  path that would have  d2172's leg caught up and tangled  between the trees as k9121 continued on  a more direct route towards town  special operative nix is now alone  there is a crash as the appendage  ricochets off a nearby tree to her right  with the remains of d2172's foot  shooting perpendicular across her path  barring progress as the length of leg  snakes behind it special operative nicks  transitions into a low slide avoiding  collision and fires into the flesh of  the leg the leg convulses as she rolls  raises to her feet ducks beneath the  limb and breaks off running after five  paces the feed shakes as she is struck  from behind and falls face first to the  ground  quickly coming to a kneel her shotgun  can be seen laying several feet away in  the brush as she begins to crawl towards  it there is a quick flash of mottled  flesh across the feed the limb crosses  in front of her once twice three times  special operative knicks groans as the  appendage warps around her looking down  it is clear that her arms are pinned to  her sides her machete lay at her hip  inches from her grasping hand as she  struggles the leg pulls back twisting in  on itself ever further coiling about her  like a snake jerking the feet about as  she is spun backwards into its many  folds  the twirling ceases and special  operative nyx screams  as the limb tightens around her the  remains of d2172's foot comes into view  it hovers before special operative nicks  there is a pair of cracks as the  remaining pinky and big toes splinter  and fracture forming two sharp prongs  that pinpoint her face it rears back  momentarily before it launches forward  just as it is about to strike special  operative nicks there is a flurry of  motion canine one two one leaps from off  camera catching  t2172's foot in its mouth the limb  writhes as the animal wrestles with the  appendage the leg loosens dropping  special operative nicks the appendage  twists and curls as k9121 tears into it  with his teeth quivering in an unnatural  manner special operative nicks crawls  toward her firearm as they contend with  one another in the background she grabs  her gun and turns in time to see the  legs sweep under the feet of canine one  two one wrap around the canine and  retract at a rapid pace the dog yelps as  the limit snares it and absconds off  into the woods away from special  operative nicks  agent collins informs special operative  knicks that she needs to progress  towards the next town she is advised to  not follow the limb and to consider the  animal a lost asset  ignoring command special operative nix  charges after the fleeing leg the knot  of flesh wrapped around canine one two  one shreds a path through the forest  ripping through the brush and felling  some of the smaller trees special  operative nyx curses and pants as she  chases after it the leg begins to draw  itself upward to pull the animal's  weight up alongside it and out of sight  as it drags itself away the mass becomes  caught up between a pair of trees  positioned beside one another k9121  whimpers as the leg constricts in an  attempt to squeeze through  special operative necks catches up  discarding her shotgun and lunging  forward with a swift blow from her  machete there is a high-pitched shriek  in the distance she strikes it again and  again  and again she bellows a long scream as  she viciously assaults the leg  cutting clear into the flesh and  revealing bone  she hacks and chops and shouts  as the dog winds and attempts to free  itself  the leg ceases its attempts to pull  through the trees and instead raises  sharply upwards knocking special  operative nicks away the cries of k9121  can be heard above her before trailing  off into the far distance  out of earshot  someone is sobbing  special operative nix screams in anger  she stands shouting threats off into the  wilderness after the leg crying out for  it to return swearing retribution it  takes several minutes for her to calm  down she radios command  asking for help to hunt the leg of d2172  and is denied she is instructed to  either investigate the tempi in her cell  or abort the mission and chooses the  former she retrieves her firearm and  continues progress  given the distance traveled during the  chase it is not long before she is met  with the farmland which encircles this  version of tembi unlike the baseline  town the farmlands here are barren not a  single piece of vegetation sprouts from  the dirt which is seen to appear dry and  infertile as she treks  onward entering the town special  operative nix stalks silently through  the streets she rounds a corner peering  into the general store as she passes  revealing several scp-783 victims  pressed up against the plate glass there  is still another on the second story of  the hardware store across the street  three more peer out from within a sedan  half parked on the curb  having crashed into a lamppost another  is visible beneath the gate of a storm  drain its face contorted and pressed up  against the bars  with enough force that bits of fat press  upwards through them none move to attack  a sudden cacophony of splintering wood  and breaking glass interrupts the  silence turning around special operative  nix sees that the buildings flanking the  end of the street have taken a broken  crooked appearance  their foundations crumble a hallmark of  scp-783's influence before special  operative nix can react the pair of  buildings collapse inwards blocking the  road she dented from  it is unknown if it is the sudden noise  or the possible presence of scp-783  itself but the corpses spotted through  the town begin to shudder violently the  trio in the car can be seen to thrash  about wildly their bones break and snap  and crack and rapidly heal  and stretch  within seconds the entirety of the sedan  is full of flesh knotted together and  writhing the windshield cracks from the  pressure  d-774 enters the control room  special operative knicks continues  towards the town center it is here that  a major deviation from baseline tembi is  discovered in the center of the  intersection before the steps of the  town hall stands a sizable wooden  platform supported on a large sturdy  base erected in the middle of the  platform as a large rounded contraption  there is an unidentifiable mound upon it  special operative nicks approaches  ascending the stairs  revealing the contraption to be a wheel  with several spokes radiating from its  center the mound is a nude disheveled  human strapped to the device face down  in each area where their limbs cross an  empty space between the wheel spokes the  appendage is gnarled and broken with  their left leg swollen and grossly  extended it trails off the side of the  platform  looking to her right a singular piece of  parchment can be seen nailed to a post  atop the stairs the document is a  sensationalized proclamation of guilt  identifying an individual by the name of  hinja woonibald the paper denounces him  as a highwayman guilty of theft child  murder  witchcraft and cannibalism it finally  goes on to state the ruling of his  punishment asserting that he is to be  broken on the wheel  special operative nicks confirms with  command that they have a clear capture  of the paper's contents before she casts  it aside she takes a moment to retract  her shotgun with slug ammunition and  moves towards the macabre display  prodding the corpse with the barrel of  the gun elicits no response she deftly  circles around to its front to get a  look at its face  nailing down  the visage of d2170  comes into view  his face is bloated features twisted in  agony upon verifying its identity  special operative nix follows the length  of his leg with her camera  seeing it lead off behind a nearby  building she states her intention to  follow it to k9121  but is interrupted by a low moan turning  back the corpse of  d2172's eyes  focus on her she reels backwards and  discharges her weapon due to the close  proximity the shot removes the upper  part of  d2172's head  the body gurgles and seethes as she  stands and fires the next two rounds  down into its trunk causing d2172  to spray a torrent of blood from the  remains of its mouth special operative  nyx recoils as she is coated in these  fluids stumbling back there is a  sickening crack  as the lower jaw of d2172 contorts and  lengthens  along the right side  and another snap as the left half breaks  and extends three more cracks see the  jawline widening  and lengthening it lashes out as she  attempts a quick load just missing her  face and spraying yet more blood that  obscures the feed the sound of special  operative knicks hurriedly descending  the staircase is heard  while there can be seen to be movement  on the camera feed no details are  discernible the next several minutes  consists primarily of audio as special  operative knicks evades and combats the  ever-breaking jaw of d-2172  all that can be heard are her shouts and  cries the breaking and splintering of  bone and the sound of rent flesh as  special operative knicks fends off the  attack with her machete in the midst of  the struggle a lone shotgun blast rings  out the weapon can be heard clattering  to the ground  before all falls silent  the feed is darkened as special  operative nix rubs the camera clearing  it to the best of her ability it will  remain smeared for the remainder of  filming but the aftermath of the  struggle can be seen  the jaw of d2172 stretches from his  corpse  and chris crosses through the  intersection blood blankets the majority  of the area and several teeth are  visible having been knocked from the gum  line special operative knicks is panting  and heaving she looks down  revealing that she lost an index finger  on her right hand  she swears as she covers it with her  free hand  in an attempt to stem the bleeding  she canvasses to the ground for the lost  digit which is then spotted laying  several feet away as she rushes towards  it it seizes and wriggles  snapping and beginning to elongate  special operative nicks turns to retreat  dipping down mid-ron to grab her firearm  as she flees  despite prodding from command special  operative nix does not return to the  execution platform to scour for more  evidence she instead rushes along the  length of the leg trailing from  d2172's corpse she curses over the radio  at agent collins casting her helmet  aside the last that is scene of special  operative nicks is her running down a  length of road  alongside  d-2172's leg she follows it around the  corner  several minutes pass uneventfully the  leg of d2172 then shifts and gyrates  slapping the ground with excessive force  for approximately 30 seconds before  becoming still  a minute later the lens spontaneously  cracks  there is heavy breathing  someone is sobbing  the area darkens as it is cast in shadow  the feed terminates as the camera is  destroyed  special operative knicks is deemed  absent without leave  with the nature of the dimension fully  understood it is determined that a fully  armed force would be required for the  capture or elimination of scp-783  scp-783-l-3  mobile task force deployed to contain  scp-783  pending declassification  scp-783-l4  okay  this concludes today's lecture  thank you for listening if indeed you  still are  and you are all dismissed  goodbye  i would like to give a special thank you  to  tomothy  anvil  zargaran  professor puffer  spencer j tilp  will rimmer  vino  gevios the hollow  zazzapan  k  dr briggs  tailored printers  cignar  alatreon  your local foundation agent  derivative  boy  a real american hebrew  the morrigan  james saba  and  nj vojak  if you would like a special thank you at  the end of each of my videos and some  other cool stuff as well visit  patreon.com  forward slash  the vulgan  thank you  you
 

